n?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional duration?: number;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2285","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2285"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Desired duration in seconds"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"logger","children":[{"type":"text","value":"logger"}]},{"type":"code","value":"logger: InternalLogger;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2293","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2293"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Internal logger threaded from the generateAudio() entry point. Adapters\nmust call logger.request() before the SDK call and logger.errors() in\ncatch blocks."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"model","children":[{"type":"text","value":"model"}]},{"type":"code","value":"model: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2281","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2281"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The model to use for audio generation"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"modeloptions","children":[{"type":"text","value":"modelOptions?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional modelOptions?: TProviderOptions;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2287","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2287"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Model-specific options for audio generation"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"prompt","children":[{"type":"text","value":"prompt"}]},{"type":"code","value":"prompt: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2283","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/types.ts:2283"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Text description of the desired audio"}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tprovideroptions","text":"TProviderOptions","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"abortsignal","text":"abortSignal?","level":3},{"id":"duration","text":"duration?","level":3},{"id":"logger","text":"logger","level":3},{"id":"model","text":"model","level":3},{"id":"modeloptions","text":"modelOptions?","level":3},{"id":"prompt","text":"prompt","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2277](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2277)\n\nOptions for audio generation (music, sound effects, etc.).\nThese are the common options supported across providers.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TProviderOptions\n\n`TProviderOptions` *extends* `object` = `object`\n\n## Properties\n\n### abortSignal?\n\n```ts\noptional abortSignal?: AbortSignal;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2299](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2299)\n\nEffective abort signal composed by the activity from caller `abortSignal`\nand/or `timeout`. Adapters should forward this to the provider SDK when\nsupported. Request-specific — never store on a global client config.\n\n***\n\n### duration?\n\n```ts\noptional duration?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2285](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2285)\n\nDesired duration in seconds\n\n***\n\n### logger\n\n```ts\nlogger: InternalLogger;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2293](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2293)\n\nInternal logger threaded from the generateAudio() entry point. Adapters\nmust call logger.request() before the SDK call and logger.errors() in\ncatch blocks.\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nmodel: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2281](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2281)\n\nThe model to use for audio generation\n\n***\n\n### modelOptions?\n\n```ts\noptional modelOptions?: TProviderOptions;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2287](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2287)\n\nModel-specific options for audio generation\n\n***\n\n### prompt\n\n```ts\nprompt: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2283](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2283)\n\nText description of the desired audio\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: AudioGenerationOptions\ntitle: AudioGenerationOptions\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2277](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2277)\n\nOptions for audio generation (music, sound effects, etc.).\nThese are the common options supported across providers.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TProviderOptions\n\n`TProviderOptions` *extends* `object` = `object`\n\n## Properties\n\n### abortSignal?\n\n```ts\noptional abortSignal?: AbortSignal;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2299](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2299)\n\nEffective abort signal composed by the activity from caller `abortSignal`\nand/or `timeout`. Adapters should forward this to the provider SDK when\nsupported. Request-specific — never store on a global client config.\n\n***\n\n### duration?\n\n```ts\noptional duration?: number;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2285](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2285)\n\nDesired duration in seconds\n\n***\n\n### logger\n\n```ts\nlogger: InternalLogger;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2293](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2293)\n\nInternal logger threaded from the generateAudio() entry point. Adapters\nmust call logger.request() before the SDK call and logger.errors() in\ncatch blocks.\n\n***\n\n### model\n\n```ts\nmodel: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2281](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2281)\n\nThe model to use for audio generation\n\n***\n\n### modelOptions?\n\n```ts\noptional modelOptions?: TProviderOptions;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2287](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2287)\n\nModel-specific options for audio generation\n\n***\n\n### prompt\n\n```ts\nprompt: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/types.ts:2283](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/types.ts#L2283)\n\nText description of the desired audio\n"}
